OL,3,GNEWSARoad reopens after firefighters
OL,4,Atackle grass fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoads have re-opened after firefighters
OL,7,Ftackled a large grass fire which
OL,8,Fdestroyed several businesses.
OL,10,FAvon Fire and Rescue Service (AFRS) was
OL,11,Fcalled to Locking Farm Industrial
OL,12,FEstate in Weston-super-Mare at 03:03
OL,13,FBST on Tuesday morning.
OL,15,FThe A371 was closed between the Asda
OL,16,FPetrol Station on Elm Tree Road and
OL,17,FLocking Farm Industrial Estate for most
OL,18,Fof the day.
OL,20,F"Firefighters have now left the scene
OL,21,Fand the local roads have reopened," a
OL,22,Fspokesperson said.
